alm overview of Made by Matt games, lessons and public learning resources, with clear routes and plain-English explanations.</p><div class="mf-actions"><a class="mf-btn primary" href="/games/">Explore games together</a><a class="mf-btn secondary" href="/resources/">Browse learning resources</a></div><div class="mf-home-links"><a href="/main/">Main homepage</a><a href="/">Choose another homepage</a></div></div></div></section><section class="mf-section" id="explore-together"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>Explore together</p><h2>Start with a real example</h2><span>These live parts of the public platform show the range without asking for an account.</span></div><div class="mf-feature-grid mf-feature-count-3"><article class="mf-feature" data-feature-id="apex-kick"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexkick/" aria-label="Play Apex Kick" data-mbm-track-recent="game-apex-kick" data-mbm-recent-route="/apexkick/"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-kick.webp" alt="Apex Kick football game artwork" width="352" height="198" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 92vw, (max-width: 1100px) 44vw, 360px"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><span class="mf-pill">Game</span><h3>Apex Kick</h3><p>A quick physics game built around planning a free kick.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexkick/" data-mbm-track-recent="game-apex-kick" data-mbm-recent-route="/apexkick/">Play Apex Kick<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-feature" data-feature-id="lesson-hub"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/" aria-label="Open the Lesson Hub" data-mbm-track-recent="page-lesson-hub" data-mbm-recent-route="/Lessons/"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/images/lesson-hub-card.webp" alt="The Lesson Hub with course, dashboard and quiz panels" width="450" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 92vw, (max-width: 1100px) 44vw, 360px"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><span class="mf-pill">Lesson Hub</span><h3>Lesson Hub</h3><p>Browse classroom material by subject, year and programme.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/" data-mbm-track-recent="page-lesson-hub" data-mbm-recent-route="/Lessons/">Open the Lesson Hub<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-feature" data-feature-id="studio-suite"><a class="mf-media" href="/Matt-s-Apps-/" aria-label="Browse the apps" data-mbm-track-recent="page-apps-hub" data-mbm-recent-route="/Matt-s-Apps-/"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/video/poster-art.webp" alt="Made by Matt art and creator-studio preview" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 92vw, (max-width: 1100px) 44vw, 360px"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><span class="mf-pill">Creative apps</span><h3>Make and create</h3><p>Explore browser-based tools for art, audio, animation and documents.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Matt-s-Apps-/" data-mbm-track-recent="page-apps-hub" data-mbm-recent-route="/Matt-s-Apps-/">Browse the apps<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-section-tint" id="parent-tips"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>Helpful starting points</p><h2>A few practical ways to use the platform</h2><span>General suggestions for exploring public content; they are not statutory, safeguarding or clinical advice.</span></div><div class="mf-tip-grid"><article class="mf-tip"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Choose together</h3><p>Open the game or resource first and decide whether it suits the learner, device and moment.</p></article><article class="mf-tip"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Use the audience homepage</h3><p>The pupil face keeps adult account and mailing actions out of the main learner journey.</p></article><article class="mf-tip"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Keep the route simple</h3><p>Use direct Play and Open actions rather than sending a learner through several hubs.</p></article><article class="mf-tip"><span aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Check the source label</h3><p>The Education Hub clearly separates Made by Matt material from official external guidance.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="mf-section" id="trusted-resources"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>Clearly labelled external help</p><h2>Trusted education and online-safety sources</h2><span>These links open filtered views in the Professional Education Hub before any external navigation.</span></div><div class="mf-route-grid"><a class="mf-route-card" href="/education-hub/?origin=external&amp;source=NSPCC"><span class="mf-route-copy"><strong>NSPCC resources</strong><small>Find NSPCC safeguarding and online-safety resources in the curated external collection.</small></span><span class="mf-route-action">View NSPCC sources<b aria-hidden="true">→</b></span></a><a class="mf-route-card" href="/education-hub/?origin=external&amp;source=Childnet"><span class="mf-route-copy"><strong>Childnet resources</strong><small>Find Childnet online-safety resources for families and education settings.</small></span><span class="mf-route-action">View Childnet sources<b aria-hidden="true">→</b></span></a><a class="mf-route-card" href="/education-hub/?origin=external&amp;source=CEOP+Safety+Centre"><span class="mf-route-copy"><strong>CEOP Safety Centre</strong><small>Reach the clearly labelled CEOP Safety Centre entries in the external collection.</small></span><span class="mf-route-action">View CEOP sources<b aria-hidden="true">→</b></span></a></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-section-tint" id="faq"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>Questions families often ask</p><h2>Parent and carer FAQ</h2></div><div class="mf-faq-list"><details class="mf-faq"><summary>Does a child need an account to use public games or lessons?</summary><div><p>No. Public games, lessons and learning areas can be opened without creating an account.</p></div></details><details class="mf-faq"><summary>What does the pupil homepage change?</summary><div><p>It changes presentation and navigation only. It does not create a child profile, grant permissions or hide other public content.</p></div></details><details class="mf-faq"><summary>Is the mailing list connected to an account?</summary><div><p>No. Teacher updates use a separate adult mailing-list process, and creating an account never subscribes anyone.</p></div></details><details class="mf-faq"><summary>Does Made by Matt replace school or safeguarding advice?</summary><div><p>No. Made by Matt provides learning content and tools. Official external material is labelled by publisher in the Education Hub.</p></div></details></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-utility-section"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>More to explore</p><h2>Useful routes from this homepage</h2><span>Every destination remains public unless the destination itself clearly explains an optional adult account feature.</span></div><div class="mf-utility-grid"><a class="mf-utility" href="/for/pupils/"><span class="mf-utility-icon"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Pupil homepage</strong><small>Open the game-first learner view.</small></span><span class="mf-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="mf-utility" href="/privacy/"><span class="mf-utility-icon"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Privacy</strong><small>Read how local preferences and recent items work.</small></span><span class="mf-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="mf-utility" href="/main/"><span class="mf-utility-icon"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Main homepage</strong><small>Explore the complete platform.</small></span><span class="mf-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-note-section"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-note"><span class="mf-note-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><div><p class="mf-note-kicker">Made by Matt boundaries</p><h2>Clear boundaries</h2><p>Made by Matt provides public educational content and browser tools. It does not provide statutory safeguarding, medical or clinical advice. Where official external resources are included, the publisher is clearly identified.</p><div class="mf-note-links"><a href="/account/">Account</a><a href="/members/">Members</a><a href="/mailing-list/">Teacher updates</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="mf-switch" aria-labelledby="switch-title"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-switch-head"><p>One platform · several front doors</p><h2 id="switch-title">Choose another homepage</h2></div><div class="mf-switch-grid"><a href="/for/pupils/">Pupils &amp; learners</a><a href="/for/teachers/">Teachers &amp; education staff</a><a href="/for/parents-carers/" aria-current="page">Parents &amp; carers</a><a href="/for/schools-semh/">Schools &amp; specialist settings</a><a href="/for/trusts/">Academy trusts &amp; education groups</a><a href="/for/councils-organisations/">Local authorities &amp; education partners</a><a href="/for/partners/">Education organisations &amp; service providers</a></div><div class="mf-switch-actions"><a class="mf-btn primary" href="/main/">Main Made by Matt homepage</a><a class="mf-btn quiet" href="/">Choose homepage</a></div></div></section></m