 class="mf-route-copy"><strong>Childnet resources</strong><small>Find Childnet online-safety resources for families and education settings.</small></span><span class="mf-route-action">View Childnet sources<b aria-hidden="true">→</b></span></a><a class="mf-route-card" href="/education-hub/?origin=external&amp;source=CEOP+Safety+Centre"><span class="mf-route-copy"><strong>CEOP Safety Centre</strong><small>Reach the clearly labelled CEOP Safety Centre entries in the external collection.</small></span><span class="mf-route-action">View CEOP sources<b aria-hidden="true">→</b></span></a></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-section-tint" id="faq"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>Questions families often ask</p><h2>Parent and carer FAQ</h2></div><div class="mf-faq-list"><details class="mf-faq"><summary>Does a child need an account to use public games or lessons?</summary><div><p>No. Public games, lessons and learning areas can be opened without creating an account.</p></div></details><details class="mf-faq"><summary>What does the pupil homepage change?</summary><div><p>It changes presentation and navigation only. It does not create a child profile, grant permissions or hide other public content.</p></div></details><details class="mf-faq"><summary>Is the mailing list connected to an account?</summary><div><p>No. Teacher updates use a separate adult mailing-list process, and creating an account never subscribes anyone.</p></div></details><details class="mf-faq"><summary>Does Made by Matt replace school or safeguarding advice?</summary><div><p>No. Made by Matt provides learning content and tools. Official external material is labelled by publisher in the Education Hub.</p></div></details></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-utility-section"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>More to explore</p><h2>Useful routes from this homepage</h2><span>Every destination remains public unless the destination itself clearly explains an optional adult account feature.</span></div><div class="mf-utility-grid"><a class="mf-utility" href="/for/pupils/"><span class="mf-utility-icon"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Pupil homepage</strong><small>Open the game-first learner view.</small></span><span class="mf-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="mf-utility" href="/privacy/"><span class="mf-utility-icon"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Privacy</strong><small>Read how local preferences and recent items work.</small></span><span class="mf-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="mf-utility" href="/main/"><span class="mf-utility-icon"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Main homepage</strong><small>Explore the complete platform.</small></span><span class="mf-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-closing-section"><div class="mf-wrap"><p class="mf-closing">If you are not sure where to start, pick one thing and let it lead. Nothing here needs planning, and you can stop whenever it stops being useful.</p></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-note-section"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-note"><span class="mf-note-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="mf-line-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 10.8 12 3.7l8.5 7.1"/><path d="M5.5 9.7v10h13v-10M9.4 19.7v-6h5.2v6"/></svg></span><div><p class="mf-note-kicker">Made by Matt boundaries</p><h2>Clear boundaries</h2><p>Made by Matt provides public educational content and browser tools. It does not provide statutory safeguarding, medical or clinical advice. Where official external resources are included, the publisher is clearly identified.</p><div class="mf-note-links"><a href="/account/">Account</a><a href="/members/">Members</a><a href="/mailing-list/">Teacher updates</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="mf-switch" aria-labelledby="switch-title"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-switch-head"><p>One platform · several front doors</p><h2 id="switch-title">Choose another homepage</h2></div><div class="mf-switch-grid"><a href="/for/pupils/">Pupils &amp; learners</a><a href="/for/teachers/">Teachers &amp; education staff</a><a href="/for/parents-carers/" aria-current="page">Parents &amp; carers</a><a href="/for/schools-semh/">Schools &amp; specialist settings</a><a href="/for/trusts/">Academy trusts &amp; education groups</a><a href="/for/councils-organisations/">Local authorities &amp; education partners</a><a href="/for/partners/">Education organisations &amp; service providers</a></div><div class="mf-switch-actions"><a class="mf-btn primary" href="/main/">Main Made by Matt homepage</a><a class="mf-btn quiet" href="/">Choose homepage</a></div></div></section></main><footer class="footer mf-footer"><div class="bar"><a class="brand" href="/main/"><img src="/assets/brand/micro_mark.svg" alt="" width="100" height="100"><span><strong>MADE BY MATT</strong><small>Learn • Build • Explore</small></span></a><span class="muted">Parents &amp; carers · <a href="/main/">Main homepage</a> · <a href="/">Choose homepage</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></span></div><div class="mbm-kofi" style="max-width:640px;margin:18px auto 6px;background:#161D3D;border:1px solid rgba(185,230,205,.35);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px;justify-content:space-between"><p style="font-size:.85rem;color:#C9D1E2;line-height:1.45;max-width:380px;margin:0;text-