-<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="header mbm-site-header"><div class="bar"><a class="brand" href="/main/"><img src="/assets/brand/micro_mark.svg" alt="" width="100" height="100"><span><strong>MADE BY MATT</strong><small>Learn • Build • Explore</small></span></a><button class="menu" id="menu" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav">Menu</button><nav class="nav mbm-site-nav" id="nav" aria-label="Site navigation"><div class="mbm-primary-links"><a href="/for/pupils/" aria-current="page">Pupil homepage</a><a href="/games/">Games</a><a href="/Lessons/">Lessons</a><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><a href="/main/">Main homepage</a></div><details class="mbm-nav-more"><summary>More</summary><div class="mbm-nav-panel"><a href="/main/">Main homepage</a><a href="/">Choose homepage</a><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></div></details><details class="mbm-theme-menu"><summary>Display</summary><div class="mbm-theme-panel"><div class="mbm-theme-slot" data-mbm-theme-slot></div></div></details></nav></div></header><main id="main"><section class="mf-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><div class="mf-hero-texture" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mf-wrap mf-hero-grid"><div class="mf-mark-stage"><span class="mf-halo mf-halo-one" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="mf-halo mf-halo-two" aria-hidden="true"></span><img class="mf-hero-mark" src="/assets/brand/hero_mark.svg" alt="" width="640" height="640" fetchpriority="high"><span class="mf-audience-badge" style="--badge-accent:#288240"><svg class="mf-badge-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2.75l1.55 5.7L19.25 10l-5.7 1.55L12 17.25l-1.55-5.7L4.75 10l5.7-1.55L12 2.75Z"/><path d="M18.5 16.5l.7 2.3 2.3.7-2.3.7-.7 2.3-.7-2.3-2.3-.7 2.3-.7.7-2.3Z"/></svg><span>Pupils &amp; learners</span></span></div><div class="mf-hero-copy"><p class="mf-kicker">A Made by Matt homepage</p><h1 id="page-title">Play first. Explore next. Learn your way.</h1><p class="mf-lead">Open a real Made by Matt game straight away, then move into lessons, pathways and creative activities when you are ready.</p><div class="mf-actions"><a class="mf-btn primary" href="#start-playing">Play a game now</a><a class="mf-btn secondary" href="/Lessons/">Explore lessons</a></div><div class="mf-home-links"><a href="/main/">Main homepage</a><a href="/">Choose another homepage</a></div></div></div></section><section class="mf-section" id="start-playing"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>Games first</p><h2>Made by Matt&#x27;s Top Picks</h2><span>Hand-picked games that earn their place by being played, not by being new.</span></div><div class="mf-pupil-rail" data-mbm-pupil-rail><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/emberwild/" aria-label="Play Emberwild"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/emberwild.svg" alt="Emberwild — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Emberwild</h3><p>An original creature-collector. Explore the Vale, battle and capture Emberkin, then follow a seam in the rock down into procedurally generated Depths — cavern, ruins, then hybrid — with loot, healing pools and a Depthwarden on the last floor. Before every throw you call your own odds, and the game then shows you the real ones. Fainting costs you the floor, never the run. One file, no install, plays offline.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> Madebymatt meets creature collecting - shh, you know the one.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/emberwild/">Play Emberwild<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/olympics/" aria-label="Play Global Games: Championship Simulator"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/global-games.svg" alt="Global Games: Championship Simulator — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Global Games: Championship Simulator</h3><p>Nine events across track, field, water, ice and snow, played out as one broadcast championship. Build an athlete&#x27;s speed, power and stamina, pick a nation, then run the 100m and the hurdles, jump and throw, swim the 50m freestyle, shoot the archery round, deliver a curling stone, take three attempts on the platform and fly the ski jump. Energy carries between days, personal bests are kept on the device, and every control, sound and graphic is generated inside the one file.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> The weather&#x27;s too hot and you&#x27;re not a pro - enjoy athletics at home.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/olympics/">Play Global Games: Championship Simulator<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexkick/" aria-label="Play Apex Kick"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-kick.webp" alt="Apex Kick — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Kick</h3><p>A single-file browser free-kick game. Drag the marker onto the goal, then flick to strike — bow your drag to bend it past the wall and the keeper. Card stats set the physics, never the dice. Works offline.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> The physics are the game. Bend one round the wall and you’ll see it.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexkick/">Play Apex Kick<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexpool/" aria-label="Play Apex Pool"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-pool.svg" alt="Apex Pool — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Pool</h3><p>Call the cue ball&#x27;s leave, then prove you can read the table. Offline 8-ball with genuine spin, position play, AI, trick shots and an honest Leave Rating.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> Good at pool - be great with Apex Pool</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexpool/">Play Apex Pool<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/relicforge/" aria-label="Play Relicforge — Strip the Machine"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/relicforge.svg" alt="Relicforge — Strip the Machine — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Relicforge — Strip the Machine</h3><p>A buried machine kingdom, dismantled component by component. Shoot the arms off and it stops shooting; take the legs and it stops chasing you. Strip every external and the core shuts down intact — and the Salvage Rating grades how surgically you did it, so patience outscores firepower. Rebuild your own chassis from what you recover, and read the kingdom&#x27;s fall in the relics you install.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> Be a warrior and solve the quest.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/relicforge/">Play Relicforge — Strip the Machine<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/voxel/" aria-label="Play Voxel Frontier"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/voxel-frontier.webp" alt="Voxel Frontier — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Voxel Frontier</h3><p>Mine, build and explore an endless procedurally generated block world — caves, trees, swimming, per-world saves. Runs offline, right in the browser.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> An endless world from a seed. Ten minutes becomes an evening.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/voxel/">Play Voxel Frontier<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/auroralinks/" aria-label="Play Aurora Links 3D"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/aurora-links-3d.svg" alt="Aurora Links 3D — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Aurora Links 3D</h3><p>A complete single-file WebGL golf game with a nine-hole tournament, four-club bag, wind and wet-weather physics, night floodlights, glowing LED balls, green reading and a playable course designer. Call your score before you play the hole and the scorecard tracks that prediction separately from your strokes, so a brave, accurate call can rescue an untidy hole. Build your own in the Course Lab and play it.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> Can&#x27;t afford your own clubs - the realism means you don&#x27;t need any.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/auroralinks/">Play Aurora Links 3D<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Off_Brand.html" aria-label="Play Off-Brand"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/off-brand.svg" alt="Off-Brand — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Off-Brand</h3><p>A whodunnit in the brand workshop: six shapes work the line and one (two later on) is a Glitch in disguise. You crack it through movement trails, the scene log and Roll Call statements — and nobody is ever voted out, everything is reversible. Designed for Matt&#x27;s sweet, adorable niece Clara.</p><p class="mf-pupil-take"><b>Matt’s take:</b> Six shapes, one impostor, zero eliminations. Clara-approved.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Off_Brand.html">Play Off-Brand<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-section-tint" id="all-games"><div class="mf-wrap"><div class="mf-section-head"><p>Every game</p><h2>Browse by kind of game</h2><span>All 54 games, grouped by what they are. Open a group and pick one.</span></div><div class="mf-pupil-genres"><details class="mf-pupil-genre" open><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Arcade &amp; Reflex</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">10 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Axiom_Shift.html" aria-label="Play Axiom Shift"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/axiom-shift.svg" alt="Axiom Shift — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Axiom Shift</h3><p>A one-button rhythm runner where the beat is something you see, not hear — a visible pulse you read instead of music, so it plays in a silent classroom and works for a deaf pupil. Four forms with genuinely different physics (jump, gravity-invert, hold-to-fly, flap), six geometric Propositions, a date-seeded Daily Shift that&#x27;s the same run for the whole class offline, and the opt-in Axiom Rule for the purists. You never lose — a touch smudges and rewinds to the last checkpoint, and your furthest progress is always kept. Offline, no accounts, no sound.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Axiom_Shift.html">Play Axiom Shift<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Globe_Snake (1).html" aria-label="Play Globe Snake"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/globe-snake.webp" alt="Globe Snake — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Globe Snake</h3><p>A unique 3D spherical twist on classic mechanics, mapping directional inputs onto non-Euclidean global surfaces.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Globe_Snake (1).html">Play Globe Snake<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Grid_Chase.html" aria-label="Play Grid Chase"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/grid-chase.webp" alt="Grid Chase — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Grid Chase</h3><p>A high-speed coordinate grid maze testing rapid directional corrections and immediate geometric mapping layout transitions.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Grid_Chase.html">Play Grid Chase<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Neon_Snake_Overdrive.html" aria-label="Play Neon Snake Overdrive"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/neon-snake-overdrive.svg" alt="Neon Snake Overdrive — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Neon Snake Overdrive</h3><p>An optimized, high-performance vector snake arena calibrated for fluid mobile and desktop response pathways.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Neon_Snake_Overdrive.html">Play Neon Snake Overdrive<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/OneGuy.html" aria-label="Play One Guy"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/one-guy.webp" alt="One Guy — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>One Guy</h3><p>A solo ghost-runner: each attempt races the recorded &#x27;ghost&#x27; of the last run on this device, so pupils compete against their own past best rather than each other. Shareable ghost codes let a run be passed on.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/OneGuy.html">Play One Guy<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Slipstream.html" aria-label="Play Slipstream"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/slipstream.webp" alt="Slipstream — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Slipstream</h3><p>A streamlined rhythmic velocity test tracking uninterrupted forward momentum and rapid gap synchronization.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Slipstream.html">Play Slipstream<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Static.html" aria-label="Play Static"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/static.webp" alt="Static — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Static</h3><p>The newest addition to the arcade — a fresh reflex-and-focus challenge for quick brain-break sessions.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Static.html">Play Static<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Trail_Runner.html" aria-label="Play Trail Runner"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/trail-runner.svg" alt="Trail Runner — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Trail Runner</h3><p>A fast-paced reflex runner navigating procedural terrain hazards. Ideal for a quick motor-skills reset.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Trail_Runner.html">Play Trail Runner<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Trekkers_Trail_Runner_Tees_Coast.html" aria-label="Play Trekkers Trail Runner — Tees Coast"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/trekkers-trail-runner-tees-coast.svg" alt="Trekkers Trail Runner — Tees Coast — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Trekkers Trail Runner — Tees Coast</h3><p>Five legs of the real AQA Walking Unit route, from Eston Rec to South Gare — set a bearing at the Rec, climb to Eston Nab, then take the dunes and loose sand at the coast. Glide the route, dodge the bog and beat the Storm; Calm Mode is there if you want the walk without the weather.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Trekkers_Trail_Runner_Tees_Coast.html">Play Trekkers Trail Runner — Tees Coast<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Vortex.html" aria-label="Play Vortex"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/vortex.webp" alt="Vortex — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Vortex</h3><p>A high-intensity tunnel-dodging experience testing rapid peripheral processing and predictive tracking accuracy.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Vortex.html">Play Vortex<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Sports</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">10 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexcurl/" aria-label="Play Apex Curl"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-curl.svg" alt="Apex Curl — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Curl</h3><p>Call the shot, then throw it. A deterministic curling sheet where ice temperature, pebble wear and the scratch left by earlier stones all move the rock, and sweeping is a real decision rather than a button. Read the draw, judge the weight, and watch the predictor line against what the stone actually does. Works offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexcurl/">Play Apex Curl<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexgolf/" aria-label="Play Apex Golf"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-golf.svg" alt="Apex Golf — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Golf</h3><p>A top-down golf game about reading the hole and knowing your own game. Call your stroke count, play nine seeded holes with honest wind and slope, then earn a Call Rating. Works offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexgolf/">Play Apex Golf<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexkick/" aria-label="Play Apex Kick"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-kick.webp" alt="Apex Kick — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Kick</h3><p>A single-file browser free-kick game. Drag the marker onto the goal, then flick to strike — bow your drag to bend it past the wall and the keeper. Card stats set the physics, never the dice. Works offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexkick/">Play Apex Kick<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexpool/" aria-label="Play Apex Pool"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-pool.svg" alt="Apex Pool — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Pool</h3><p>Call the cue ball&#x27;s leave, then prove you can read the table. Offline 8-ball with genuine spin, position play, AI, trick shots and an honest Leave Rating.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexpool/">Play Apex Pool<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexrally/" aria-label="Play Apex Rally"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-rally.svg" alt="Apex Rally — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Rally</h3><p>Read the court before the ball arrives. A rally duel against opponents who adapt as you learn them — aim, time and spin every shot, bank Apex Focus by reading the bounce early, then finish the point from the baseline or at the net. Works offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexrally/">Play Apex Rally<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apextennis/" aria-label="Play Apex Tennis"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-tennis.svg" alt="Apex Tennis — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Tennis</h3><p>Call the point before the serve, then build it on court. A complete offline tennis game with real rules, three rival styles and an honest Plan Rating.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apextennis/">Play Apex Tennis<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/apexvelodrome/" aria-label="Play Apex Velodrome"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/apex-velodrome.svg" alt="Apex Velodrome — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Apex Velodrome</h3><p>Track racing where the match you have is the one you spend. Ride the bankings with real aerodynamics, draft that you can feel arriving, and an anaerobic reserve that does not come back. Points races, the Madison hand-sling, keirin and pursuit, against riders who read the race as you do. Works offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/apexvelodrome/">Play Apex Velodrome<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/auroralinks/" aria-label="Play Aurora Links 3D"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/aurora-links-3d.svg" alt="Aurora Links 3D — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Aurora Links 3D</h3><p>A complete single-file WebGL golf game with a nine-hole tournament, four-club bag, wind and wet-weather physics, night floodlights, glowing LED balls, green reading and a playable course designer. Call your score before you play the hole and the scorecard tracks that prediction separately from your strokes, so a brave, accurate call can rescue an untidy hole. Build your own in the Course Lab and play it.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/auroralinks/">Play Aurora Links 3D<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/olympics/" aria-label="Play Global Games: Championship Simulator"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/global-games.svg" alt="Global Games: Championship Simulator — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Global Games: Championship Simulator</h3><p>Nine events across track, field, water, ice and snow, played out as one broadcast championship. Build an athlete&#x27;s speed, power and stamina, pick a nation, then run the 100m and the hurdles, jump and throw, swim the 50m freestyle, shoot the archery round, deliver a curling stone, take three attempts on the platform and fly the ski jump. Energy carries between days, personal bests are kept on the device, and every control, sound and graphic is generated inside the one file.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/olympics/">Play Global Games: Championship Simulator<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/neonturf/" aria-label="Play Neon Turf: Overdrive"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/neon-turf-overdrive.svg" alt="Neon Turf: Overdrive — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Neon Turf: Overdrive</h3><p>Rocket-powered hover cars, one ball, and a floor that remembers who drove over it. Score in the net to lead — but every wheel-track paints the grid, and if the clock runs out level the team holding the most turf takes the decision. Three arenas of bumpers, gravity wells and portals: Neon Foundry, Singularity Court and Warp Circuit. Run the Arcade Cup solo, take a Local Duel on one screen, or drill it in the Training Lab.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/neonturf/">Play Neon Turf: Overdrive<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Strategy &amp; Puzzle</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">8 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/biopunkhive/" aria-label="Play Biopunk Hive"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/biopunk-hive.svg" alt="Biopunk Hive — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Biopunk Hive</h3><p>A single-file biopunk incremental game: grow a forbidden containment hive, harvest cadence, manage toxicity and stabilise breaches before they spread, then distil cryo-stasis condensate and prestige into a stronger run.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/biopunkhive/">Play Biopunk Hive<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/echovault/" aria-label="Play Echo Vault — Sound Is Your Light"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/echo-vault.svg" alt="Echo Vault — Sound Is Your Light — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Echo Vault — Sound Is Your Light</h3><p>A pitch-black vault you can only see by making noise. Every sonar pulse paints the architecture in travelling light — and tells every hunter down there exactly where you are. Read the room before it answers, hold your breath to go cold, or throw a loud ping across the hall and walk the other way while they chase it. Sound is your light and your danger, and choosing when to spend it is the whole game.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/echovault/">Play Echo Vault — Sound Is Your Light<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Hold_the_Mark.html" aria-label="Play Hold the Mark"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/hold-the-mark.webp" alt="Hold the Mark — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Hold the Mark</h3><p>Built mobile-first for phones and tablets. Defend the Made by Matt mark with brand-shape towers, Harmony combos and a calm-play Focus meter. Six levels — including Kerning Run, where the route slides sideways mid-wave — plus thumb gestures, daily challenges, unlockable tower skins and Mark themes. Works offline in any orientation.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Hold_the_Mark.html">Play Hold the Mark<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Lumins.html" aria-label="Play Lumins"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/lumins.webp" alt="Lumins — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Lumins</h3><p>A Lemmings-style rescue puzzle: assign roles to your Lumins to dig, build and bridge them safely to the exit — complete with a full level editor.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Lumins.html">Play Lumins<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Neon_Siege.html" aria-label="Play Neon Siege"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/neon-siege.svg" alt="Neon Siege — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Neon Siege</h3><p>A localized matrix defense challenge requiring calculated tactical placement and rapid prioritization under pressure.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Neon_Siege.html">Play Neon Siege<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/neonsync/" aria-label="Play Neon Sync"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/neon-sync.svg" alt="Neon Sync — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Neon Sync</h3><p>A 3v3 neon point-control arena where the score is not your aim — what counts is whether you were the teammate everyone wants. Hold the point, back your squad and get endorsed by AI teammates who state their reasons. Bots have human reaction times and cannot out-track you, so matches are decided by reading the fight rather than by twitch.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/neonsync/">Play Neon Sync<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Prism.html" aria-label="Play Prism"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/prism.svg" alt="Prism — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Prism</h3><p>A perspective-shifting puzzle manipulating light angles, alignment paths, and spatial refraction lines.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Prism.html">Play Prism<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/The_Last_Lighthouse_v1_1_The_Archipelago_Update_FINAL.html" aria-label="Play The Last Lighthouse"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/the-last-lighthouse.svg" alt="The Last Lighthouse — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>The Last Lighthouse</h3><p>A keeper survival game: hold the last lighthouse watch by watch, guiding vessels safely through storms and Tempest conditions. Earn Keeper Marks, build your Keeper Record, and explore the new archipelago map — now updated to v1.1 with portable backup codes so progress can move between devices.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/The_Last_Lighthouse_v1_1_The_Archipelago_Update_FINAL.html">Play The Last Lighthouse<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Party &amp; Whole-Class</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">6 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Charcoal.html" aria-label="Play Charcoal"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/charcoal.svg" alt="Charcoal — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Charcoal</h3><p>A short hide-and-seek round in the Made by Matt studio: six shapes, one quietly smudging finished work back to rough with a stick of charcoal, and one carrying the fixative can — a single spray that seals it. Read the charcoal dust, spend your ink drops on a Blot, a Trace or the Studio lights, and two friends re-ink any shape that&#x27;s gone rough. You rotate through every role and nothing is ever lost for good. Made with love for Matt&#x27;s niece Clara ♥.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Charcoal.html">Play Charcoal<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/KidsVsStaff_Showdown (3).html" aria-label="Play Kids vs Staff: Showdown"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/kids-vs-staff-showdown.webp" alt="Kids vs Staff: Showdown — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Kids vs Staff: Showdown</h3><p>Whole-class team quiz: pupils take on the staff across scored rounds. Class-vs-teacher framing — no individual leaderboard.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/KidsVsStaff_Showdown (3).html">Play Kids vs Staff: Showdown<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Off_Brand.html" aria-label="Play Off-Brand"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/off-brand.svg" alt="Off-Brand — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Off-Brand</h3><p>A whodunnit in the brand workshop: six shapes work the line and one (two later on) is a Glitch in disguise. You crack it through movement trails, the scene log and Roll Call statements — and nobody is ever voted out, everything is reversible. Designed for Matt&#x27;s sweet, adorable niece Clara.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Off_Brand.html">Play Off-Brand<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/WorldCup_v3_MatchDirector.html" aria-label="Play World Cup v3 — Match Director"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/world-cup-v3-match-director.webp" alt="World Cup v3 — Match Director — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>World Cup v3 — Match Director</h3><p>Run a match as director — Made by Matt arcade.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/WorldCup_v3_MatchDirector.html">Play World Cup v3 — Match Director<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/WorldCup_v5_Showdown.html" aria-label="Play World Cup v5 — Showdown"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/world-cup-v5-showdown.webp" alt="World Cup v5 — Showdown — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>World Cup v5 — Showdown</h3><p>Head-to-head showdown — Made by Matt arcade.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/WorldCup_v5_Showdown.html">Play World Cup v5 — Showdown<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/WorldCup_ThreeLions_Final.html" aria-label="Play World Cup: Road to the Three Lions Final"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/world-cup-road-to-the-three-lions-final.webp" alt="World Cup: Road to the Three Lions Final — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>World Cup: Road to the Three Lions Final</h3><p>Teacher-driven end-of-term tournament: three nations, possession and steals, stadium codes, a VAR twist and a cooperative England final. Auto-tallied scoring and evidence print included.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/WorldCup_ThreeLions_Final.html">Play World Cup: Road to the Three Lions Final<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Physics &amp; Simulation</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">5 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Grapple.html" aria-label="Play Grapple"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/grapple.webp" alt="Grapple — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Grapple</h3><p>A momentum-centric physics playground focusing on vector hook connections and conservation of kinetic energy.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Grapple.html">Play Grapple<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Marble.html" aria-label="Play Marble"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/marble.webp" alt="Marble — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Marble</h3><p>A tilt-and-gravity simulator testing meticulous physical adjustment, balancing thresholds, and micro-coordination.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Marble.html">Play Marble<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/medevac/" aria-label="Play Medevac Frontier"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/medevac/medevac_frontier_banner.png" alt="Medevac Frontier — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Medevac Frontier</h3><p>Train with Unit 734, then fly Twilight and Night Canyon medevac runs. Land in the green zone, guide the litter teams out under a running clock — three litters a trip — then decide how many supply crates to risk before you clear the rim. Every completed mission tightens the canyon, and your service record carries over. Works offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/medevac/">Play Medevac Frontier<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Orbital.html" aria-label="Play Orbital"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/orbital.webp" alt="Orbital — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Orbital</h3><p>A physics-based gravitational simulation mapping kinetic momentum, planetary vectors, and circular mechanics.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Orbital.html">Play Orbital<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Wrecking_Crew.html" aria-label="Play Wrecking Crew"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/wrecking-crew.svg" alt="Wrecking Crew — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Wrecking Crew</h3><p>A destructive physics environment evaluating structural integrity, mass distributions, and center-of-gravity impacts.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Wrecking_Crew.html">Play Wrecking Crew<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Adventure &amp; RPG</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">5 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Glitch_Clash.html" aria-label="Play Glitch Clash"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/glitch-clash.webp" alt="Glitch Clash — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Glitch Clash</h3><p>NEW ACT II — the campaign runs to fifteen stages now, ending in the Deep Static. Collect 24 Keepers across the brand shapes, mix your trio for Harmony, then fight through shifting arena modifiers, Glitch Corruption you can ride or purge, Glyph Alchemy hybrid moves, and beam Clashes you win on timing rather than luck. Five animated story moments. Gentle by design, offline-friendly, phone-first.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Glitch_Clash.html">Play Glitch Clash<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/emberwild/" aria-label="Play Emberwild"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/emberwild.svg" alt="Emberwild — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Emberwild</h3><p>An original creature-collector. Explore the Vale, battle and capture Emberkin, then follow a seam in the rock down into procedurally generated Depths — cavern, ruins, then hybrid — with loot, healing pools and a Depthwarden on the last floor. Before every throw you call your own odds, and the game then shows you the real ones. Fainting costs you the floor, never the run. One file, no install, plays offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/emberwild/">Play Emberwild<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/ouroboros/" aria-label="Play Ouroboros: Chronos Unbound"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/ouroboros.webp" alt="Ouroboros: Chronos Unbound — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Ouroboros: Chronos Unbound</h3><p>Four visionaries and one dying clockwork city. A self-contained anime tactical RPG: break the city&#x27;s logic, sever its sub-nodes, chain resonance techniques between bound heroes, forge equipment from salvaged materials, climb the Spire, and decide whether a broken timeline deserves preservation — or change. One file, no install, plays offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/ouroboros/">Play Ouroboros: Chronos Unbound<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/relicforge/" aria-label="Play Relicforge — Strip the Machine"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/relicforge.svg" alt="Relicforge — Strip the Machine — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Relicforge — Strip the Machine</h3><p>A buried machine kingdom, dismantled component by component. Shoot the arms off and it stops shooting; take the legs and it stops chasing you. Strip every external and the core shuts down intact — and the Salvage Rating grades how surgically you did it, so patience outscores firepower. Rebuild your own chassis from what you recover, and read the kingdom&#x27;s fall in the relics you install.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/relicforge/">Play Relicforge — Strip the Machine<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/fracture/" aria-label="Play Relicforge: Fracture Engine"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/fracture-engine.svg" alt="Relicforge: Fracture Engine — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Relicforge: Fracture Engine</h3><p>Three realms are breaking apart, and their relic logic is the only way through. Take a Forgeguard, a Riftcaller or a Shadowsmith into Ironwood Verge for its Forge Shards, the Glitchworks for its Fracture Pylons, and the Celestial Foundry for the Nullsmith itself. Temper relics at the forge between fights, read every ground telegraph before it lands, then export a Chronicle of the whole run — a standalone evidence record, generated locally, with no account and no server.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/fracture/">Play Relicforge: Fracture Engine<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Racing &amp; Driving</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">4 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/neonmeridian/" aria-label="Play Neon Meridian: Open Drive"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/neon-meridian.webp" alt="Neon Meridian: Open Drive — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Neon Meridian: Open Drive</h3><p>Free driving in Meridian Bay, a dense original coastal city built for landmarks, traffic and discovery. Take delivery runs, checkpoint runs and circuit races, bank the credits, then spend them in the garage on engine, tyres and brakes. Twelve landmarks across seven districts, weather and a day-night sky, holdable on one phone. Offline, single file, no account.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/neonmeridian/">Play Neon Meridian: Open Drive<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/rallyvector3d/" aria-label="Play Rally Vector 3D — Championship Edition"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/rally-vector-3d.webp" alt="Rally Vector 3D — Championship Edition — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Rally Vector 3D — Championship Edition</h3><p>A six-stage rally season on tarmac, sand, snow, wet coast, forest gravel and canyon shale. Read the holographic pace notes, keep it out of the fords and the breakable props, then spend your service-park minutes on the damage that matters. Every stage records a ghost you can race yourself against. Offline, single file, touch controls.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/rallyvector3d/">Play Rally Vector 3D — Championship Edition<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Slipstream_GP.html" aria-label="Play Slipstream - GP"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/slipstream-gp.svg" alt="Slipstream - GP — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Slipstream - GP</h3><p>Climb the eight-rival ladder — draft, slingshot, overtake. Touch controls with a brake, garage upgrades, daily sprint, and a velocity–time graph in school mode.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Slipstream_GP.html">Play Slipstream - GP<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/hyperdraft/" aria-label="Play Slipstream GP: Hyperdraft"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/slipstream-hyperdraft.svg" alt="Slipstream GP: Hyperdraft — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Slipstream GP: Hyperdraft</h3><p>Drafting rebuilt as three zones you can feel: a turbulent fringe, a vacuum pocket that charges your boost, and dirty air that takes your grip and cooks the engine. Pull sideways out of the pocket and the slingshot fires. Four circuits including Stormline, where standing water, hydroplaning and lightning fight you the whole way round. Four rival personalities — the Blocker, the Apex Purist, the Leech and the Wildcard — and any of them will hold a grudge after contact. Offline, no account, nothing uploaded.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/hyperdraft/">Play Slipstream GP: Hyperdraft<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Sandbox &amp; Creative</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">4 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/luminahaven/" aria-label="Play Lumina Haven"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/lumina-haven.svg" alt="Lumina Haven — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Lumina Haven</h3><p>A low-pressure sanctuary game about arranging a beautiful room, nurturing unusual plants, collecting gems and crafting luminous new décor. Set the greenhouse weather, repaint the walls and resize the room, then take two materials to the Botanical &amp; Gem Fusion bench — known pairings unlock rare living décor, dyes and lights, and experimental ones still make essence. The Soundscape Mixer is generated live by Web Audio with no sound files, and Photo Mode exports the room only, no interface.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/luminahaven/">Play Lumina Haven<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/Neon_Garden.html" aria-label="Play Neon Garden"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/neon-garden.svg" alt="Neon Garden — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Neon Garden</h3><p>An ambient, low-arousal pattern-generation loop designed for focus conditioning and cognitive pacing.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/Neon_Garden.html">Play Neon Garden<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/voxel/" aria-label="Play Voxel Frontier"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/voxel-frontier.webp" alt="Voxel Frontier — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Voxel Frontier</h3><p>Mine, build and explore an endless procedurally generated block world — caves, trees, swimming, per-world saves. Runs offline, right in the browser.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/voxel/">Play Voxel Frontier<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/Lessons/Games/voxelcraft.html" aria-label="Play VoxelCraft"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/voxelcraft.svg" alt="VoxelCraft — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>VoxelCraft</h3><p>The original prototype — a localized 3D block builder exploring spatial coordinates, geometry, and structural placement. Superseded by Voxel Frontier, the full engine.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/Lessons/Games/voxelcraft.html">Play VoxelCraft<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details><details class="mf-pupil-genre"><summary><span class="mf-pupil-gname">Action &amp; Survival</span><span class="mf-pupil-gnum">2 games</span></summary><div class="mf-pupil-grid"><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/neonbreach/" aria-label="Play Neon Breach"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/neon-breach.svg" alt="Neon Breach — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Neon Breach</h3><p>Survive escalating drone waves in a procedural neon arena. Three weapons — Pulse Rifle, Arc Scattergun and Ion Rail — each want a different range, and eight perks are drafted after every wave clear into a build you choose rather than one you unlock. Full touch controls, and it pauses itself when you switch away.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/neonbreach/">Play Neon Breach<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="mf-pupil-game"><a class="mf-media" href="/novasiege/" aria-label="Play Vector Overdrive: Nova Siege"><img data-mbm-real-visual src="/assets/cards/nova-siege.webp" alt="Vector Overdrive: Nova Siege — a moment from play" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="mf-feature-copy"><h3>Vector Overdrive: Nova Siege</h3><p>Twin-stick survival in a full 360° arena. Break a living threat budget wave after wave: graze enemy fire to charge your overdrive, evolve one weapon through four tiers, draft upgrades between waves, and hold off a three-phase dreadnought every fifth wave. Keyboard, gamepad or touch sticks; scores stay on your device. One file, no install, plays offline.</p><a class="mf-text-link" href="/novasiege/">Play Vector Overdrive: Nova Siege<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div></details></div></div></section><section class="mf-section mf-surprise" id="surprise" data-mbm-surprise-set="[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;/emberwild/&quot;,&quot;route&quot;:&quot;/emberwild/&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Emberwild&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;/novasiege/&quot;,&quot;route&quot;:&quot;/novasiege/&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Vector Overdrive: Nova Siege&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;/ouroboros/&quot;,&quot;route&quot;:&quot;/ouroboros/&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Ouroboros: Chronos Unbound&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;/olympics/&quot;,&quot;route&quot;:&quot;/olympics/&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Global Games: Championship Simulator&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;/fracture/&quot;,&quot;route&quot;:&quot;/fracture/&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Relicforge: Fracture Engine&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;/neonturf/&quot;,&quot;route&quot;:&quot;/neonturf/&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Neon Turf: Overdrive&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;/ec